OL,3,GNEWSATests of contaminated soil to be
OL,4,Acarried out
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to collect samples of contaminated
OL,7,Fsoil from an embankment outside an
OL,8,Fairport is set to begin.
OL,10,FThe States agreed in June to spend up
OL,11,Fto #16.5m to remove, export and treat
OL,12,Fmore than 15,000 tonnes of soil
OL,13,Fcontaminated with Perfluorooctane
OL,14,Fsulfonate, also known as PFOS, outside
OL,15,FGuernsey Airport.
OL,17,FPFOS was historically used in
OL,18,Ffirefighting foam and is known as a
OL,19,F"forever chemical" because it does not
OL,20,Fbreak down easily in the environment
OL,21,Fand may pose risks to health.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
