OL,3,GNEWSATests of contaminated soil to be
OL,4,Acarried out
OL,5,
OL,6,FContractors from the UK were expected
OL,7,Fto start drilling holes to extract
OL,8,Fsamples from 10 locations around the
OL,9,Fmound for treatment.
